{
  "_comment": [
    "FLUX.2 [Klein] 9B - IMAGE EDIT, with 3 reference-image slots and 4 LoRA slots.",
    "Export (API) format, for a bitGen Studio image style (Rendered by ComfyUI).",
    "",
    "Flattened from ComfyUI's published template (uploaded by Tim):",
    "  image_flux2_klein_image_edit_9b_base.json",
    "Node types, widget names and wiring were read out of that file, not guessed.",
    "The published version wraps this in subgraphs ('Image Edit' + three nested",
    "'Reference Conditioning' blocks), which are a UI-only construct; this is the",
    "same graph flattened, which is what Export (API) produces and /prompt accepts.",
    "",
    "HOW A REFERENCE IMAGE IS USED: LoadImage -> ImageScaleToTotalPixels (1 MP) ->",
    "VAEEncode -> a PAIR of ReferenceLatent nodes, one on the positive chain and",
    "one on the negative. The three blocks chain, so image 2 conditions on top of",
    "image 1. Reference image 1 also drives GetImageSize, which sets the output",
    "resolution - an edit keeps the source's dimensions, so the style's width and",
    "height are deliberately NOT used here.",
    "",
    "SLOTS 81/82/83 (images) and 101-104 (LoRAs) ship BYPASSED. bitGen Studio fills",
    "them from the request and the style, and removes the unused ones before",
    "queueing. AT LEAST ONE REFERENCE IMAGE IS REQUIRED: this workflow edits a",
    "picture, and with no picture there is nothing to edit (and nothing to take",
    "the output size from).",
    "",
    "MODELS (into ComfyUI's OWN folders):",
    "  models/diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-9b.safetensors",
    "  models/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors",
    "  models/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors",
    "The style's Model / VAE / text-encoder fields override these when set."
  ],
